      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you on the balance thing, but honestly, isn't that just a way to sugarcoat things? if we're always trying to find a way to make the bad stuff fit into a \"growth and progress\" narrative, aren't we just failing to teach the actual truth of how these systems work? sometimes being \"balanced\" feels like we're just avoiding the hard reality that some parts of our history are just plain wrong.",
